      "Larger and heavier than a 5,000 BTU unit",
      "Installation takes more care than a standard box unit",
      "Not suited to slider or casement windows"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The best small window AC for a bedroom or office where noise and running cost matter more than the lowest price.",
