          A 5,000 BTU box unit cools a small bedroom for little money. An inverter unit does it quietly. A slider unit fits the windows a standard box will not. Six picks, matched to the room and the window.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="#midea-u-shaped-8000-btu-inverter"
            class="px-8 py-4 bg-[#FF4500] hover:bg-[#E63E00] text-white font-black rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all no-underline"
          >
